    "html": "<p align=\"center\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"4\" face=\"Tahoma\">\nIf you would like the most current update of the standings\ndelivered automatically to your email address every week, you may register for this\nservice by entering the information requested below: </font></p>\n\n<div align=\"center\"><table><tr><td>\n<FORM ACTION=\"http://formmailto.com/cgi-bin/odbicb.exe/formmailto/odb/sendform.odb\" METHOD=\"post\">\n<INPUT TYPE=\"hidden\" NAME=\"form\" VALUE=\"bullseyepistol/orderad\">\n<TABLE width='450'>\n<INPUT NAME=\"Hello\" TYPE=\"hidden\" SIZE=32 VALUE=\"Kirk!\">\n<INPUT NAME=\"Register me for\" TYPE=\"hidden\" SIZE=32 VALUE=\"IL-MO League Email Standings\">\n<TR><TD ALIGN=left><FONT FACE='tahoma' SIZE=4 COLOR='#000000'>\n<B>Full Name</B>\n<font color=red>*</font><INPUT NAME=\"check\" TYPE=\"hidden\"  VALUE=\"R=Full Name&#132;Name\">\n</FONT></TD>\n<TD><FONT FACE='tahoma' SIZE=4 COLOR='#000000'>\n<INPUT NAME=\"Name\" TYPE=\"text\" SIZE=24 VALUE=\"\">\n</FONT></TD></TR>\n<TR><TD ALIGN=left><FONT FACE='tahoma' SIZE=4 COLOR='#000000'>\n<B>Email Address</B>\n<font color=red>*</font><INPUT NAME=\"check\" TYPE=\"hidden\"  VALUE=\"R=Email Address&#132;Email\">\n</FONT></TD>\n<TD><FONT FACE='tahoma' SIZE=4 COLOR='#000000'>\n<INPUT NAME=\"Email\" TYPE=\"text\" SIZE=33 VALUE=\"\">\n<INPUT NAME=\"check\" TYPE=\"hidden\"  VALUE=\"5=Email Address&#132;Email\">\n</FONT></TD></TR>\n</TABLE>\n<P><INPUT TYPE=\"submit\" VALUE=\"Register\">\n</FORM></td></tr></table>\n\n<P><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"4\" face=\"Tahoma\">This is a free service provided by Secretary/Treasurer, Kirk Yates</font></p>\n\n</div>",
    "text": "If you would like the most current update of the standings\ndelivered automatically to your email address every week, you may register for this\nservice by entering the information requested below:\nFull Name\n*\nEmail Address\n*\nThis is a free service provided by Secretary/Treasurer, Kirk Yates"
